{"slug":"007784","name":"Konami 007784","maker":"Konami","markings":["007784"],"summary":"The sprite data parser. Fed the unparsed object table, it adds the scroll registers to each sprite's position, sets the sprite-enable bit only when the result is in range, and writes a parsed table back to RAM. It can also fill the table with zeros to clear it.","conflicts":[],"role":"Konami Custom Sprite Data Parser IC","package":{"pins":42,"symbol":"ga_konami:007784_internal"},"pins":[{"n":"1","name":"TEST","dir":"in","from":"board","drive":""},{"n":"2","name":"~{OBFI}","dir":"in","from":"board","drive":"in"},{"n":"3","name":"DMA","dir":"in","from":"board","drive":"in"},{"n":"4","name":"BEFLG","dir":"out","from":"board","drive":"out"},{"n":"5","name":"OD15","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"6","name":"OD14","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"7","name":"OD13","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"8","name":"OD12","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"9","name":"OD11","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"10","name":"OD10","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"11","name":"VSS","dir":"power","from":"board","drive":"in"},{"n":"12","name":"OD9","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"13","name":"OD8","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"14","name":"OD7","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"15","name":"OD6","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"16","name":"OD5","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"17","name":"OD4","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"18","name":"OD3","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"19","name":"OD2","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"20","name":"OD1","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"21","name":"OD0","dir":"in/out","from":"board","drive":"in/out"},{"n":"22","name":"DB0","dir":"in","from":"board","drive":"in"}