kind":"function","text":"The 007784 does the following things:\n\n- Sets BEFLAG high if bit OD15 is set on every eight words in.\n  Otherwise BEFLAG goes low. DMA does not need to be active.\n- All other words in need DMA to be active to be parsed.\n- Calculates the final vertical and horizontal positions of the sprite\n  by using the sprite position in the unparsed object table and the\n  horizontal and vertical scroll registers. It is written to a new parsed\n  object table in RAM.\n- The Sprite Enable (SPRTEN) bit is only set if the position is within\n  the allowed range.\n- When OBFI (OBJBUFINIT) in is high, only zeros are written to data out.\n  That is to reset the object RAM table."}],"readFrom":null,"pdf":"/chips/007784.pdf","license":"GPL-3.0","origin":{"project":"jtcores","url":"https://github.com/jotego/jtcores/tree/e7b11263b04978790d4a3b9dd7e188b2dc976e4b/cores/twin16/sch/007784","commit":"e7b11263b04978790d4a3b9dd7e188b2dc976e4b","path":"cores/twin16/sch/007784","authors":["Jose Tejada","Ulf Skutnabba"],"license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/stoatworks-labs/cathode-ray-tomes/blob/main/kicad/chips/007784/LICENSE","source":"https://github.com/stoatworks-labs/cathode-ray-tomes/tree/main/kicad/chips/007784","imported":"2026-10-20"},"kicanvas":{"base":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stoatworks-labs/cathode-ray-tomes/main/kicad/chips/007784/","files":["007784.kicad_sch","scroll.kicad_sch","data_io.kicad_sch","clocks_and_reset.kicad_sch"],"bytes":759094},"boards":[{"slug":"final-round-gx870","name":"The Final Round PCB (GX870)","mfr":"Konami","year":"1988","license":"GPL-3.0","refs":[{"ref":"U8","section":"Sprites1"}],"machines":["fround"]},{"slug":"twin-16-gx687","name":"Twin 16 (GX687 / GX785)","mfr":"Konami","year":"1987","license":"GPL-3.0","refs":[{"ref":"B_K3","section":"Sprite Table"}],"machines":["devilw","vulcan"]},{"slug":"twin-16-rev-b","name":"Twin 16 rev B (GX785 / GX870 / GX808 / GX903)","mfr":"Konami","year":"1988","license":"G